# List of native fluid field labels for grid sub-dumps (OPT__OUTPUT_SUBDIV_GRID = 1).
# One label per non-comment line.  The input label is case-sensitive.
#
# Supported labels (HYDRO):
#   Conserved  : Dens, MomX, MomY, MomZ, Engy
#   Passive    : any user-defined passive scalar (check Init_Field.cpp for labels)
#
# Note:
# --> This file controls ONLY native (conserved + passive) fluid fields.
#     Derived fields (VelX/Y/Z, Pres, Temp, Entr, Eint, Pote, CC-Mag, ParDens, etc.)
#     are controlled by their respective OPT__OUTPUT_* flags in Input__Parameter.
#     Set those flags to 0 if you do not want them written in sub-dumps.
# --> If this file is absent, all native fluid fields are written (same as default).
# --> The output field label in the HDF5 sub-dumps matches the label exactly (no prefix added).
#
Dens
